msgid "Typed factory, static instances and polymorphic faces"
msgstr "类型化 factory、静态实例与多态 face"

msgid "The current platform keeps typed factory lookup and C polymorphism. Configuration generates the exact instances; factory lookup returns them without constructing, initializing, locking or discovering anything. Hardware startup and request execution are separate explicit actions."
msgstr "当前平台保留 typed factory 查找和 C 多态。配置生成精确实例；factory 查找只返回它们，不构造、初始化、加锁或探测。硬件启动和请求执行是各自显式动作。"

msgid "![Current factory IDs, shared readonly ops and independent instance contexts](../assets/diagrams/factory-instances.svg)"
msgstr "![当前 factory ID、共享只读 ops 与独立实例 context](../assets/diagrams/factory-instances.svg)"

msgid "Current factory IDs, shared readonly ops and independent instance contexts"
msgstr "当前 factory ID、共享只读 ops 与独立实例 context"

msgid "FIG-04 shows the current identity structure. A controller and a child endpoint have different interfaces and IDs even when their implementation shares a physical bus."
msgstr "FIG-04 表示当前身份结构。Controller 与 child endpoint 有不同接口和 ID，即使实现共享同一物理总线。"

msgid "What generation owns"
msgstr "生成器拥有的责任"

msgid "One schema-2 TOML selects instance names, bindings, modes and exact capacities. The strict resolver produces typed IR; emitters publish readonly faces, shared ops references, private independent contexts, fixed IRQ wiring and compact getters. Native assemblies receive independent model state too; a test singleton is not the production instance-generation mechanism."
msgstr "一份 schema-2 TOML 选择实例名、binding、模式和精确容量。严格 resolver 产生 typed IR；emitter 发布只读 face、共享 ops 引用、独立私有 context、固定 IRQ 接线和紧凑 getter。Native 装配同样取得独立模型状态；测试单例不是生产实例生成机制。"

msgid "`nexus_factory.h` is generated for each assembly, so its IDs are not a universal header or persistent numbering scheme. Default IDs are compact `uint16_t` aliases with named constants. COUNT, invalid and unselected entries return NULL. Optional nominal strong IDs and capability records are explicit configuration choices; a chip capability record does not grant Board routing or physical qualification."
msgstr "每次装配生成自己的 `nexus_factory.h`，其 ID 不是通用 header 或持久编号。默认 ID 是紧凑 `uint16_t` alias 和具名常量。COUNT、无效和未选择项返回 NULL。可选 nominal strong ID 与 capability record 必须明确配置；芯片能力记录不授予 Board route 或物理资格。"

msgid "What a call does"
msgstr "一次调用执行什么"

msgid "Action"
msgstr "动作"

msgid "Work performed"
msgstr "实际工作"

msgid "`nx_factory_uart(id)`"
msgstr "`nx_factory_uart(id)`"

msgid "Select and return an existing readonly UART face"
msgstr "选择并返回已有只读 UART face"

msgid "`nx_platform_start()`"
msgstr "`nx_platform_start()`"

msgid "Execute selected setup and retain cleanup outcomes"
msgstr "执行选定初始化，保留清理结果"

msgid "Public I/O operation"
msgstr "公共 I/O 操作"

msgid "Validate face, then dispatch `ops(context, ...)`"
msgstr "验证 face，再分发 `ops(context, ...)`"

msgid "IRQ entry"
msgstr "IRQ 入口"

msgid "Access the fixed concrete provider and its owned hardware"
msgstr "访问固定具体 provider 和其拥有的硬件"

msgid "Explicit service/wait"
msgstr "显式 service/wait"

msgid "Advance or observe the selected lifecycle"
msgstr "推进或观察选定生命周期"

msgid "Stop"
msgstr "Stop"

msgid "Close/drain according to contract; cannot revoke outstanding storage"
msgstr "按合同关闭/排空；不能提前收回仍在借用的存储"

msgid "Products may retain a face for the provider-storage lifetime. Stopping hardware does not revoke a pointer or synchronize callers. The application must quiesce callers and publishers before reclaiming external adapter storage. No getter changes mode or silently acquires execution ownership."
msgstr "产品可在 provider 存储生命周期内保留 face。停止硬件不会撤销指针，也不会同步调用方。应用必须确保调用方与 publisher 停止访问并完成必要同步，才能回收外部 adapter 存储。Getter 不改变模式或悄悄取得执行所有权。"

msgid "Verify the generated design"
msgstr "验证生成设计"

msgid "This complete maintained assembly selects independent Native instances:"
msgstr "以下完整维护装配选择独立 Native 实例："

msgid "Maintained generated factory fixture; its software Board is not a physical PCB."
msgstr "维护中的生成 factory 夹具；其软件 Board 不是物理 PCB。"

msgid "The [async tutorial](../tutorials/async-io.md) runs the complete generated factory binary. It verifies cold lookup, distinct contexts with shared ops, bus/endpoint identity, invalid IDs, stop/restart and retained quarantine. The authority for these interfaces is the [integration contract](../design/integration-contracts.md) and generated/public headers; this page explains the design rather than duplicating function declarations."
msgstr "[异步教程](../tutorials/async-io.md)运行完整生成 factory binary，验证冷态查找、共享 ops 下的独立 context、bus/endpoint 身份、无效 ID、stop/restart 和隔离保留。这些接口的权威是[接入合同](../design/integration-contracts.md)及生成/公开 header；本页解释设计，不重复函数声明。"

